OL,3,GNEWSAJury begins fifth day of
OL,4,Adeliberations in Noah Donohoe inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury at the inquest into the death
OL,7,Fof Belfast schoolboy Noah Donohoe has
OL,8,Fstarted its fifth day of deliberations.
OL,10,FThe deliberations resumed on Monday
OL,11,Fmorning after being adjourned at the
OL,12,Fbeginning of July to facilitate summer
OL,13,Fholiday arrangements.
OL,15,FThe inquest has been examining
OL,16,F14-year-old Noah's disappearance and
OL,17,Fdeath in north Belfast in June 2020.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
