OL,3,GNEWSAJury begins fifth day of
OL,4,Adeliberations in Noah Donohoe inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury is comprised of seven men and
OL,7,Ftwo women following a decision to
OL,8,Fremove a juror which was announced by
OL,9,Fthe coroner, Mr Justice Rooney, with
OL,10,Freasons not made public.
